  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "一杯美式咖啡  (Coffee With a Label Insider)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a cafe, Xingzi meets an agent from Yuanye to find out why singer Xin Huimei cannot perform on Twelve Singers. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "咱们有日子没见了，你瘦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "给你买了杯美式咖啡。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "谢谢啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你要是没事，肯定不来找我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "还真有事，惠美到底有什么情况啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "她现在跟公司闹得很僵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "登台演出的机会一律不许接。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "演出雪藏？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "对，公司只给她接综艺节目的通告。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你也知道，惠美就是个纯歌手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那我们的节目她来不了了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "怎么了？怪事来了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's unpack what they say. The agent greets Xingzi warmly as he sits down at her table.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "咱们有日子没见了，你瘦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have not seen each other in ages, and you lost weight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "给你买了杯美式咖啡。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I bought you a cup of black coffee.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "谢谢啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thanks.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你要是没事，肯定不来找我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you did not need something, you definitely would not come looking for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "还真有事，惠美到底有什么情况啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I really do have something to ask, what on earth is going on with Huimei?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "她现在跟公司闹得很僵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Things are very tense between her and the company right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "登台演出的机会一律不许接。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is not allowed to take any stage performance opportunities at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "演出雪藏？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Her performances are frozen?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "对，公司只给她接综艺节目的通告。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, the company only takes variety-show bookings for her.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你也知道，惠美就是个纯歌手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As you know, Huimei is purely a singer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那我们的节目她来不了了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then she cannot come on our show anymore?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "怎么了？怪事来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is this? Something strange just came up!'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "咱们有日子没见了，你瘦了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "给你买了杯美式咖啡。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "谢谢啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你要是没事，肯定不来找我。",
      "gap": 0.5
