    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "怎么了？怪事来了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Just as the agent explains that Yuanye froze Xin Huimei's singing gigs while leaving variety bookings open, a surprise message arrives. You learned cafe talk with \"meishi kafei\", urgent questions with \"daodi\", and industry slang like \"xuecang\". See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
